    attacks this turn, your opponent cannot activate cards or effects until the end
    of the Damage Step.\r\n\u25CF 6: Add 1 Beast-Warrior monster from your Deck to
    your hand.\r\n\u25CF 10: Special Summon 1 Beast-Warrior monster from your Deck
    or Extra Deck, ignoring its Summoning conditions."
